481	
482	## Touch Target Sizes
483	
484	Minimum 44x44px for touch targets (Apple HIG):
485	
486	```css
487	.btn,
488	.nav-link,
489	.icon-btn {
490	  min-height: 44px;
491	  min-width: 44px;
492	}
493	
494	@media (max-width: 768px) {
495	  .btn {
496	    padding: 14px 24px; /* Larger touch area */
497	  }
498	}
499	```
